{"id":"3e305602e1a0f243","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-poincare.md","title":"Poincaré Recurrence","display":"thm-poincare — Poincaré Recurrence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-poincare","aliases":["58-thm-poincare"],"display":"thm-poincare — Poincaré Recurrence","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-poincare"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-poincare</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-poincare — Poincaré Recurrence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> 为有限测度空间</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:X\\to X\">\\(T:X\\to X\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 是本文件定义的有限迭代序列谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterate\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S(\\vec T,T,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec T,\\omega,X^X)\n\\land\\vec T(0)=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec T(n+1)(x)=T(\\vec T(n)(x))\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterate\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S(\\vec T,T,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec T,\\omega,X^X)\n\\land\\vec T(0)=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec T(n+1)(x)=T(\\vec T(n)(x))\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poincare}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S(\\vec T,T,X)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mu\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{x\\in A\\middle|\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\land\\vec T(n)(x)\\in A)\n\\right\\}\n\\right)=\\mu(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poincare}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S(\\vec T,T,X)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mu\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{x\\in A\\middle|\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\land\\vec T(n)(x)\\in A)\n\\right\\}\n\\right)=\\mu(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Poincaré 复现定理断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中几乎每一点无限多次返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；旧文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(A\\cap T^{-n}A)&gt;\\mu(A)^2-\\varepsilon\">\\(\\mu(A\\cap T^{-n}A)&gt;\\mu(A)^2-\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是另一类相关复现估计，并非该定理的标准结论。</li>\n<li>This is a basic result in ergodic theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 已替换为从恒等映射开始、按复合递归得到的集合函数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec T\">\\(\\vec T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T:X\\to X$ 且 $\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)$（see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"T:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterate\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S(\\vec T,T,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(T,X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec T,\\omega,X^X)\n\\land\\vec T(0)=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec T(n+1)(x)=T(\\vec T(n)(x))\n\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poincare}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mu(X)<\\infty\n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathrm{IterateSequence}_S(\\vec T,T,X)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mu\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{x\\in A\\middle|\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\land\\vec T(n)(x)\\in A)\n\\right\\}\n\\right)=\\mu(A)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(A\\cap T^{-n}A)>\\mu(A)^2-\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec T","display":false}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-poincare.md|58-thm-poincare]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["785c80475c01fc69","36d7463d215be751"]}